<newsitem itemid="367475" id="root" date="1997-02-10" xml:lang="en">
<title>USA: Safety-Kleen Corp Q4 net up.</title>
<headline>Safety-Kleen Corp Q4 net up.</headline>
<dateline>ELGIN, Ill. 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.35		    $0.31</p>
<p> Net			 20,424		   17,975</p>
<p> Revs		     296,950		  263,971</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  58,364		   57,882</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.05		    $0.92</p>
<p> Net			 61,109		   53,303</p>
<p> Revs		     923,126		  859,251</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  58,152		   57,857</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 is 16-week fourth interim period. Co uses three 12-week periods and a fourth 16-week interim period with fiscal year ending on Saturday closest to Dec. 31.</p>
<p>1995 fourth interim period includes $12-million pre-tax charge to increase reserves for environmental remediation costs, and $15.2-million pre-tax credit to reduce restructuring reserves established in 1993. Neither item had an effect on earnings.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
